t/pull/120021.patch","merged_at":"2026-06-24T15:21:14Z"},"body":"As per #102787 \"**Add Toki Pona (tok) to language/locale list.**\", this one-liner adds toki pona to language_script_list with the `\"Latn\"` code, as per [unicode.org/.../languages_and_scripts](https://www.unicode.org/cldr/charts/48/supplemental/languages_and_scripts.html#tok)\r\n\r\nBeforehand, this language did not show up in the `application/config/name_localized`'s \"Select a Locale\" window, for example. After this change was tested, toki pona is now available to choose!\r\n\r\n(Shoutout to @EGAMatsu for initiating)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120021/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120021/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}